          {"study_index": 2, "title": "Multi‐institutional clinical studies on hyperthermia combined with radiotherapy  
  or chemotherapy in advanced cancer of deep‐seated organs.", "abstract": "Multi-institutional studies on clinical      
  hyperthermia of deep-seated tumours were undertaken using 8 MHz radiofrequency capacitive heating devices             
