          {"study_index": 4, "title": "Comparison of radiotherapy alone with radiotherapy plus hyperthermia in locally  
  advanced pelvic tumours: a prospective, randomised, multicentre trial. Dutch Deep Hyperthermia Group", "abstract":    
  "BACKGROUND Local-control rates after radiotherapy for locally advanced tumours of the bladder, cervix, and rectum    
