          {"study_index": 40, "title": "Genetic dissection of apoptosis and cell cycle control in response of           
  colorectal cancer treated with preoperative radiochemotherapy", "abstract": "In previous analyses we identified       
  therapy-induced upregulation of the CDK inhibitor p21CIP/WAF-1 and consequently decreased tumor cell proliferation    
