│ excision.  The New England Journal Of Medicine"}, {"study_index": 46, "title": "Effective surgical adjuvant therapy  │
│ for high‐risk rectal carcinoma", "abstract": "Background Radiation therapy as an adjunct to surgery for rectal       │
